@TicketFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Registro de usuário (sempre cria um Customer)
POST {{TicketFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "uma-senha-forte-123"
}

### Login: devolve access token (15 min) e refresh token (7 dias)
# @name login
POST {{TicketFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "uma-senha-forte-123"
}

### Refresh: troca o refresh token por um novo par (o antigo deixa de valer)
# @name refresh
POST {{TicketFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout: revoga o refresh token
POST {{TicketFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

###
